:: Vincent - An Old Debt - Followup
<h1 class="ptitle">FARM</h1>
<br /><br />
<<set $characters.vincent.quests.old_debt_followup_day = $game.day>>
<center>
	<<image 'people/vincent/sitting.jpg' sfw>>
</center>
<br />
You found Vincent sitting out front, turning something over in his head long before he said any of it out loud.
<br /><br />
<<if $characters.vincent.quests.old_debt_method === 'fight'>>
	<<vincent>>
		Been thinking about Silas. Not proud of how far I let that go, but I can't say I lose sleep over it either. Some debts you just collect. Thanks for not talking me out of it.
	<</vincent>>
<<elseif $characters.vincent.quests.old_debt_method === 'paid'>>
	<<vincent>>
		Still thinking about that trading post. Wasn't the ending I pictured for ten years, but it's an ending. Appreciate you keeping a level head out there when I couldn't.
	<</vincent>>
<<else>>
	<<vincent>>
		Been thinking about that trading post. About Silas, walking around alive like none of it happened. Still turns my stomach some. But you were right to talk me down. Wouldn't have been able to live with the alternative.
	<</vincent>>
<</if>>
<br />
<<link 'Leave'>>
	<<goto 'Farm'>>
<</link>>
